        "action": "Do not ban social media for Year 11 students ",
        "additional_details": "",
        "background": "Due to exam season being in May/June, many Year 11s do not turn 16 until during or after this. Some social media apps can help students with revision. We feel this is important because some students require different ways to revise.",
